"The signature could not be saved because of a server error. Please try "
"again; if it keeps failing, ask a site administrator to check the error log."
msgstr ""
"No se pudo guardar la firma por un error del servidor. Inténtalo de nuevo; "
"si sigue fallando, pide a un administrador del sitio que revise el registro "
"de errores."

#: src/Api/Controllers/SignaturesController.php:360
#: src/Api/Controllers/TeamSignaturesController.php:298
#: src/Services/SignatureService.php:386
msgid "Signature not found."
msgstr "No se encontró la firma."

#: src/Api/Controllers/SignaturesController.php:489
msgid "Your WordPress account has no email address on file."
msgstr ""
"Tu cuenta de WordPress no tiene una dirección de correo electrónico "
"registrada."

#: src/Api/Controllers/SignaturesController.php:499
msgid "No HTML supplied to send."
msgstr "No se proporcionó HTML para enviar."

#. translators: %d: maximum size in KB.
#: src/Api/Controllers/SignaturesController.php:509
