"Hi %s — here is the signature you just designed in Imagina Signatures. Copy "
"it from below and paste it into your email client."
msgstr ""
"Hola, %s: esta es la firma que acabas de diseñar en Imagina Signatures. "
"Cópiala desde abajo y pégala en tu cliente de correo."

#: src/Api/Controllers/SignaturesController.php:581
msgid "wp_mail() failed. Check your site's email configuration."
msgstr "wp_mail() falló. Revisa la configuración de correo de tu sitio."

#. translators: %s: comma-separated list of option keys that failed to save.
#: src/Api/Controllers/SiteSettingsController.php:221
#, php-format
