#: src/Api/Controllers/SiteSettingsController.php:281
msgid "Brand kit write did not round-trip. Check the WordPress error log."
msgstr ""
"El kit de marca no se guardó correctamente. Revisa el registro de errores de "
"WordPress."

#: src/Api/Controllers/SiteSettingsController.php:290
msgid "Banner campaigns write did not round-trip."
msgstr "Las campañas de banners no se guardaron correctamente."

