#: assets/editor/src/editor/modals/ExportModal.tsx:714
msgid ""
"Google Workspace: if the signature box is missing or locked, your "
"administrator manages signatures centrally."
msgstr ""
"Google Workspace: si el cuadro de la firma no aparece o está bloqueado, tu "
"administrador gestiona las firmas de forma centralizada."

