"Press Windows + R, paste %s and press Enter. Create the \"Signatures\" "
"folder if it does not exist."
msgstr ""
"Pulsa Windows + R, pega %s y pulsa Enter. Crea la carpeta \"Signatures\" si "
"no existe."

