"Press \"Open signature in a new tab\" (Safari works best). The tab shows "
"only the signature."
msgstr ""
"Pulsa \"Abrir la firma en una pestaña nueva\" (funciona mejor en Safari). La "
"pestaña muestra solo la firma."

#: src/Deployment/Install/InstallPage.php:442
#: assets/editor/src/editor/modals/ExportModal.tsx:517
msgid "In that tab press Cmd + A, then Cmd + C."
msgstr "En esa pestaña, pulsa Cmd + A y luego Cmd + C."

#: src/Deployment/Install/InstallPage.php:443
#: assets/editor/src/editor/modals/ExportModal.tsx:518
msgid ""
"Open Mail → Settings… → Signatures, pick the account on the left and click "
"\"+\" to add a signature."
msgstr ""
"Abre Mail → Ajustes… → Firmas, elige la cuenta a la izquierda y haz clic en "
"\"+\" para añadir una firma."

#: src/Deployment/Install/InstallPage.php:444
#: assets/editor/src/editor/modals/ExportModal.tsx:521
