"the signature’s fonts with your default font."
msgstr ""
"Desmarca \"Usar siempre mi tipo de letra predeterminado para los mensajes\"; "
"si no, Mail reemplaza las fuentes de la firma por tu fuente predeterminada."

#: src/Deployment/Install/InstallPage.php:445
#: assets/editor/src/editor/modals/ExportModal.tsx:524
msgid ""
"Click into the signature area on the right, delete the placeholder text and "
"paste (Cmd + V). Close the window; Mail saves automatically."
msgstr ""
