msgstr "Vuelve atrás para guardar."

#: src/Deployment/Install/InstallPage.php:462
#: assets/editor/src/editor/modals/ExportModal.tsx:557
msgid "Gmail app (Android / iPhone)"
msgstr "App de Gmail (Android / iPhone)"

#: src/Deployment/Install/InstallPage.php:465
#: assets/editor/src/editor/modals/ExportModal.tsx:560
msgid ""
"The Gmail app’s own \"Mobile signature\" is plain text only — images, "
"colours and links are not kept. For the full visual signature, install it in "
"Gmail on a computer (Gmail tab)."
msgstr ""
"La \"Firma para móviles\" propia de la app de Gmail es solo texto sin "
"formato: no conserva imágenes, colores ni enlaces. Para tener la firma "
"visual completa, instálala en Gmail desde un equipo (pestaña Gmail)."

#: src/Deployment/Install/InstallPage.php:466
msgid ""
"To set the text version: in the app open Settings → your account → Mobile "
"signature and paste the signature (only its text is kept)."
msgstr ""
"Para configurar la versión de texto: en la app, abre Ajustes → tu cuenta → "
"Firma para móviles y pega la firma (solo se conserva el texto)."

#: src/Deployment/Install/InstallPage.php:469
#: assets/editor/src/editor/modals/ExportModal.tsx:569
msgid "Outlook app (Android / iPhone)"
msgstr "App de Outlook (Android / iPhone)"

#: src/Deployment/Install/InstallPage.php:473
#: assets/editor/src/editor/modals/ExportModal.tsx:575
msgid ""
"Open the Outlook app → Settings → Signature (per account when offered) and "
"paste."
msgstr ""
"Abre la app de Outlook → Ajustes → Firma (por cuenta, si se ofrece la "
"opción) y pega."

#: src/Deployment/Install/InstallPage.php:474
#: assets/editor/src/editor/modals/ExportModal.tsx:578
msgid ""
"How much formatting survives depends on the app version: send yourself a "
"message to check, and keep the mobile signature simple if images are dropped."
msgstr ""
"Cuánto formato se conserva depende de la versión de la app: envíate un "
"mensaje para comprobarlo y, si se pierden las imágenes, mantén sencilla la "
"firma para móviles."

